    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "pandas.DataFrame.sparse.to_dense# DataFrame.sparse.to_dense()[source]# Convert a DataFrame with sparse values to dense. Returns: DataFrameA DataFrame with the same values stored as dense arrays. Examples >>> df = pd.DataFrame({\"A\": pd.arrays.SparseArray([0, 1, 0])}) >>> df.sparse.to_dense() A 0 0 1 1 2 0",
